"""The "Chi sono" page, in the four languages of the site.

Facts come from Angelo (November 2026): piano at the Conservatorio Benedetto Marcello in Venice, then
modern guitar with a focus on rock and blues and live concerts, productions (hip hop and rap first,
then techno), sound engineering at schools and courses in Italy and abroad, recording studios on both
sides of the glass (learning from top engineers, recording guitars and productions as artist and
session player), studios in Milan and in Friuli, a modern sound that stays alive, where roundness and
melody come first. Twenty years of piano, twelve of guitar, more than fifteen years full time.
Numbers about clients match the rest of the site. Names of single schools, bands and studios are not
given: they go here only when Angelo sends them. No street address anywhere: only Milan and Friuli.
"""

